    "intro_html":  "Tikka masala is the most ordered curry in the world for a reason, and it wraps up better than you would think. We marinate chicken breast in spiced yogurt the traditional way, sear it, and simmer it into a tomato masala loosened with a little more yogurt instead of cream, then fold it around rice in a wrap. Each burrito lands \u003cstrong\u003eunder 400 calories with 4 ounces of meat\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e36 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, on a high fiber tortilla that keeps you near 5 grams of net carb. We have Slow Cooker Chicken Tikka Masala Rice Bowls on the site; this is the seared, hand-held version, and it is the only Indian plate in this batch.",
